WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.780 --> 00:00:17.127
"Can we stop to rest?"

2
00:00:17.487 --> 00:00:18.928
moaned Bajie one day.

3
00:00:20.488 --> 00:00:24.090
The group had spent the morning walking down a long mountain trail.

4
00:00:24.110 --> 00:00:27.031
"My knees feel weak!"

5
00:00:27.352 --> 00:00:28.032
cried the pig.

6
00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:32.441
"We'll rest in a little while, Bajie," said the Tang Monk.

7
00:00:33.822 --> 00:00:37.763
As they walked, the travelers started to hear the sound of rushing water.

8
00:00:39.024 --> 00:00:40.525
It grew louder and louder.

9
00:00:40.545 --> 00:00:43.746
"We're approaching a river," said Wujing.

10
00:00:45.106 --> 00:00:46.467
trail went around a hill.

11
00:00:48.468 --> 00:00:50.929
A moment later the travelers saw the river.

12
00:00:50.989 --> 00:00:54.150
"How will we cross this river?"

13
00:00:54.430 --> 00:00:55.351
said the Tang Monk.

14
00:00:56.451 --> 00:00:58.632
"It's so wide, I can't see the other side."

15
00:00:59.552 --> 00:01:01.933
Wukong leaped into the air and looked around.

16
00:01:05.354 --> 00:01:07.235
a small village nearby," he said.

17
00:01:07.255 --> 00:01:09.696
"Maybe someone there has a boat."

18
00:01:12.517 --> 00:01:13.758
group walked to the village.

19
00:01:14.698 --> 00:01:16.059
The street was deserted.

20
00:01:17.599 --> 00:01:20.701
A few villagers peeked out of windows and from behind doors.

21
00:01:22.641 --> 00:01:23.602
They looked scared.

22
00:01:24.602 --> 00:01:26.423
A man was getting water from a well.

23
00:01:26.443 --> 00:01:28.924
"Hello!" said Wukong.

24
00:01:30.380 --> 00:01:33.982
Startled, the man dropped his bucket down the well and spun around.

25
00:01:34.002 --> 00:01:37.683
"Wh-who are you?"

26
00:01:38.603 --> 00:01:40.084
Tang Monk stepped forward.

27
00:01:40.104 --> 00:01:42.865
"I'm from the Tang Empire.

28
00:01:42.925 --> 00:01:45.926
We're traveling to the Western Paradise to get scriptures from Buddha."

29
00:01:47.767 --> 00:01:48.868
man relaxed a bit.

30
00:01:49.528 --> 00:01:50.308
"That's wonderful!"

31
00:01:51.309 --> 00:01:54.230
"We need a boat to get across the river," said Bajie.

32
00:01:55.410 --> 00:01:57.031
don't have a boat," said the man.

33
00:01:57.051 --> 00:01:59.724
"But someone in the village might.

34
00:02:00.064 --> 00:02:00.545
come with me.

35
00:02:01.105 --> 00:02:01.865
I'll make some tea.

36
00:02:02.746 --> 00:02:03.446
My name is Chen."

37
00:02:06.928 --> 00:02:08.929
The travelers followed Chen to his home.

38
00:02:10.630 --> 00:02:13.812
Inside, they sat down as Chen boiled water for tea.

39
00:02:13.832 --> 00:02:17.334
"Why does everyone in this village seem so scared?"

40
00:02:17.594 --> 00:02:18.514
asked the Tang Monk.

41
00:02:21.196 --> 00:02:22.696
sighed and sat down.

42
00:02:24.517 --> 00:02:25.678
He started to cry.

43
00:02:27.479 --> 00:02:29.140
dear man," said the Tang Monk.

44
00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:30.601
"What's wrong?

45
00:02:30.761 --> 00:02:31.582
Did I upset you?"

46
00:02:32.583 --> 00:02:34.865
"No," said Chen through his tears.

47
00:02:34.885 --> 00:02:38.668
"It's just that life is very bad in this village.

48
00:02:40.190 --> 00:02:42.932
A few years ago, a terrible demon arrived.

49
00:02:44.634 --> 00:02:47.676
He's always treated us badly, but now things are worse.

50
00:02:48.477 --> 00:02:50.279
He demanded that we give him a child.

51
00:02:51.059 --> 00:02:53.522
If we don't, he'll destroy our entire village.

52
00:02:54.663 --> 00:02:58.313
Tomorrow morning I must hand over my son!"

53
00:02:59.814 --> 00:03:01.916
Chen burst into tears all over again.

54
00:03:01.936 --> 00:03:06.098
Wukong giggled and then laughed.

55
00:03:06.919 --> 00:03:08.580
Tang Monk glared at the monkey.

56
00:03:08.600 --> 00:03:11.502
"Wukong! Why are you laughing?"

57
00:03:12.282 --> 00:03:13.403
Bajie shook his head.

58
00:03:13.924 --> 00:03:14.904
cruel, Master.

59
00:03:15.785 --> 00:03:17.946
You should recite the Tight Headband spell."

60
00:03:19.507 --> 00:03:22.649
"There's no need for that," said Wukong, still laughing.

61
00:03:23.710 --> 00:03:24.450
turned to Chen.

62
00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:27.328
"I'm not laughing at you, sir.

63
00:03:27.388 --> 00:03:30.210
I'm laughing because today is the luckiest day of your life."

64
00:03:31.811 --> 00:03:32.931
raised his eyebrows.

65
00:03:32.951 --> 00:03:34.112
"How am I lucky?"

66
00:03:36.953 --> 00:03:39.295
"You've probably never heard of me," said Wukong.

67
00:03:39.315 --> 00:03:42.857
"But I am Sun Wukong, the Monkey King.

68
00:03:43.677 --> 00:03:46.218
I once defeated the Jade Emperor's entire army.

69
00:03:47.199 --> 00:03:49.460
And tomorrow I will save your son's life."

70
00:03:49.480 --> 00:03:51.601
"Are you a spirit?"

71
00:03:51.921 --> 00:03:52.522
asked Chen.

72
00:03:52.542 --> 00:03:56.204
"Yes, a very powerful spirit," said Wukong.

73
00:03:57.256 --> 00:03:58.036
your son out here.

74
00:03:58.297 --> 00:03:59.197
I need to look at him."

75
00:04:00.337 --> 00:04:01.858
Chen left the room for a moment.

76
00:04:04.219 --> 00:04:06.440
When he came back, a small boy was with him.

77
00:04:06.460 --> 00:04:09.041
"This is my son," said Chen.

78
00:04:15.804 --> 00:04:18.605
Wukong walked around the boy, examining him closely.

79
00:04:22.726 --> 00:04:26.508
Finally the monkey folded his arms and said, "I have a plan."

80
00:04:28.736 --> 00:04:31.617
The next morning the boy climbed onto a small platform.

81
00:04:32.597 --> 00:04:35.498
Several villagers carried the platform to the edge of the river.

82
00:04:37.519 --> 00:04:40.440
They placed the platform on the ground and then backed away.

83
00:04:43.540 --> 00:04:45.161
a moment everything was quiet.

84
00:04:46.361 --> 00:04:48.102
The boy sat alone on the platform.

85
00:04:49.462 --> 00:04:51.403
Suddenly a dark cloud approached.

86
00:04:53.723 --> 00:04:56.304
fierce-looking demon emerged from the cloud.

87
00:04:57.033 --> 00:04:58.177
It had sharp teeth.

88
00:04:59.302 --> 00:05:01.229
The boy smiled at the demon.

89
00:05:01.269 --> 00:05:02.655
"Hello!"
